A(('h1', S4))
A(('p', '4.1 The fig tree: Jesus gives no explanation. For the story of Luke 13:6–9, Luke records no request for an explanation and no answer. The sayings before it (13:2–5) and the comparison after it (13:18–19) are not given as explanations of it. This part of the section therefore records no identification, because there is none to record.'))
A(('p', '4.2 What Jesus does not identify in the fig tree story. Jesus does not identify the man. Jesus does not identify the fig tree. Jesus does not identify the vineyard. Jesus does not identify the dresser. Jesus does not identify the fruit. Jesus does not identify the three years or the one year more. Jesus does not identify the digging and the dunging. Jesus does not identify the cutting down.'))
