A(('call', 'Boundaries to Remember',
   'No explanation from Jesus for the fig tree, so no identity for the man, the dresser, the tree, the vineyard or the fruit. No identity for the fellows, wisdom or her children. No symbol carried in from the Fig Tree Lesson, the Two Sons, the New Cloth and New Wineskins or any other passage. Seeking fruit, bearing fruit and repenting are parts of a story and a message to the hearers of that day, not steps of salvation for the Body. The lessons are principles of conduct, not a transfer of Kingdom identity to the Body.'))

